        <text x='60' y='196' fill='#666D80' fontSize='18' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>条并发告警</text>
        <text x='272' y='196' fill='#34D399' fontSize='18' fontWeight='bold' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>条根因</text>
        <rect x='40' y='240' width='350' height='56' rx='10' fill='#161A24' stroke='#2C3346' />
        <text x='215' y='274' fill='#A4ABBD' fontSize='17' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>收敛发生在边缘过滤与集群归因之后</text>
